            </Buff>
          </Cloak>
          <Belt>
            <Name>Arkat's Cord (Level 14)</Name>
            <Icon>Belt_2</Icon>
            <Description>Found by a slain foe in Gainthold, this cloth belt's former owner is identified
by the name sewn into its lining.</Description>
            <DropLocation>A Cry for Help, and Foundation of Discord, end chest (heroic elite)</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>14</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
              <Belt/>
            </EquipmentSlot>
            <Material>Cloth</Material>
            <Buff>
              <Type>ReinforcedFists</Type>
            </Buff>
          </Belt>
          <Goggles>
            <Name>Goggles of Grabbing</Name>
            <Icon>Goggles_1</Icon>
            <Description>The Clan Tunnelworm Warden would sometimes use these goggles to halt a potential
prisoner in their tracks, simply by staring them down.</Description>
            <DropLocation>The Lost Seekers, End reward</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>3</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
